    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn With Me is a narrative-driven roguelike deckbuilder soaked in cozy dread and forbidden rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the lives of occult university students who discover ancient rites and invocations with the help of their passionate Teacher. Face their personal trials, summon new creatures, synergize them, and burn to uncover the depths of obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/32d59ec515edfddd6a97596c6c467452.poster.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/32d59ec515edfddd6a97596c6c467452.webm?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/32d59ec515edfddd6a97596c6c467452.mp4?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We tried to capture a special type of &quot;strangeness&quot; \u2014 a comforting one, inviting you to be part of it\u2026 while also keeping you on the edge of your seat, never knowing what to expect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However, there are some exceptions that you can definitely expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy but eerie\u00a0narrative-driven deckbuilder with roguelike elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique position-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently burning your cards as one of the main mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/2f0a5670971a3dbf0c41f098717df008.poster.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/2f0a5670971a3dbf0c41f098717df008.webm?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/2f0a5670971a3dbf0c41f098717df008.mp4?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark overarching story set in a magical world, where students learn occult arts at university</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7+ chapters and characters, with gameplay adjusting to reflect their deepest fears and obsessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/5443b2181c74975be400da49e5e12e55.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Burn With Me is a bold experiment \u2014 a visual symbiosis of handcrafted art and real-life videos \u2014 spliced with a unique perspective on &quot;deckbuilding.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We hope you enjoy playing it as much as we enjoyed creating it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/14c853cabd4b843515143006d738fb4e.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn With Me is a narrative-driven roguelike deckbuilder soaked in cozy dread and forbidden rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the lives of occult university students who discover ancient rites and invocations with the help of their passionate Teacher. Face their personal trials, summon new creatures, synergize them, and burn to uncover the depths of obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/32d59ec515edfddd6a97596c6c467452.poster.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/32d59ec515edfddd6a97596c6c467452.webm?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/32d59ec515edfddd6a97596c6c467452.mp4?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We tried to capture a special type of &quot;strangeness&quot; \u2014 a comforting one, inviting you to be part of it\u2026 while also keeping you on the edge of your seat, never knowing what to expect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However, there are some exceptions that you can definitely expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy but eerie\u00a0narrative-driven deckbuilder with roguelike elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique position-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently burning your cards as one of the main mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/2f0a5670971a3dbf0c41f098717df008.poster.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/2f0a5670971a3dbf0c41f098717df008.webm?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/2f0a5670971a3dbf0c41f098717df008.mp4?t=1755343261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark overarching story set in a magical world, where students learn occult arts at university</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7+ chapters and characters, with gameplay adjusting to reflect their deepest fears and obsessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/5443b2181c74975be400da49e5e12e55.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Burn With Me is a bold experiment \u2014 a visual symbiosis of handcrafted art and real-life videos \u2014 spliced with a unique perspective on &quot;deckbuilding.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We hope you enjoy playing it as much as we enjoyed creating it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954010/extras/14c853cabd4b843515143006d738fb4e.avif?t=1755343261\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p>",
